## DNSApi

### Create a new authoritative DNS zone seeded with apex A + NS + SOA records
## Create a new authoritative DNS zone seeded with apex A + NS + SOA records
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Add a DNS record (A, AAAA, MX, TXT, CNAME, NS, SRV, CAA, ...) to a zone
## Add a DNS record (A, AAAA, MX, TXT, CNAME, NS, SRV, CAA, ...) to a zone
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns/{{id}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Permanently delete a DNS zone and every record it contains
## Permanently delete a DNS zone and every record it contains
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Permanently delete one DNS record from a zone — zone itself is preserved
## Permanently delete one DNS record from a zone — zone itself is preserved
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns/{{domainId}}/{{recordId}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### List every DNS record in one zone with the IDs needed to edit or delete them
## List every DNS record in one zone with the IDs needed to edit or delete them
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### List DNS zones hosted on the account with each zone&#39;s apex A-record IP
## List DNS zones hosted on the account with each zone&#39;s apex A-record IP
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

### Replace values on an existing DNS record (name, type, content, ttl, priority)
## Replace values on an existing DNS record (name, type, content, ttl, priority)
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/dns/{{domainId}}/{{recordId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}
